  "notes": [
    "**Leer** is an -ER verb with spelling changes",
    "Present: regular -ER conjugation",
    "Preterite: spelling change i→y in 3rd person (leyó, leyeron), accent on other forms (leí, leíste, leímos)",
    "Imperfect: regular -ER pattern with accent on \"í\" (leía, leías, etc.)",
    "Pretérito Perfecto: past participle **leído** with accent",
    "Future: regular future endings attached to infinitive",
    "Condicional: regular conditional endings attached to infinitive",
    "Similar pattern to **caer** (to fall) and **creer** (to believe)",
    "Common usage: *leer un libro* (to read a book), *leer en voz alta* (to read aloud)",
    "Related noun: **la lectura** (reading), **el/la lector/lectora** (reader)"
